# App-owned ModSecurity overrides for the Scalingo nginx buildpack.

# Remove every rule the buildpack loads, so ONLY our own custom rules run.
#
# The buildpack (which owns the http-level include, with no env var to tune it)
# loads two rule sets in blocking mode: its base modsecurity.conf rules in the
# 200000-200999 range, and the full OWASP CRS in the 900000-999999 range. This
# file is parsed AFTER that include, so the rules exist by the time we strip
# them. `SecRuleRemoveById` only affects rules parsed BEFORE it, so our custom
# rules — the geo IP filter (id:1000) lives in geo-filter.modsecurity, wired in
# AFTER this file — are untouched and still evaluated.
SecRuleRemoveById "200000-200999" "900000-999999"

# Disable request/response body inspection.
SecRequestBodyAccess Off
SecResponseBodyAccess Off
